      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我要喝水。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ yào hē shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, I want to drink some water."
    },
    {
