      "traditional": "媽媽：一叫你寫作業，你就愛磨洋工。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma yí jiào nǐ xiě zuò yè nǐ jiù ài mó yáng gōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "30分钟就能写完的作业，你都拖了3个小时了，还没写完！",
      "traditional": "30分鐘就能寫完的作業，你都拖了3個小時了，還沒寫完！",
      "pinyin": "2 fēn zhōng jiù néng xiě wán de zuò yè nǐ dōu tuō le 1 ge xiǎo shí le hái méi xiě wán",
      "english": "Mom: As soon as I tell you to do your homework, you just love to idle on the job."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "赶快写作业！写完才能吃水果！",
      "traditional": "趕快寫作業！寫完才能吃水果！",
      "pinyin": "gǎn kuài xiě zuò yè xiě wán cái néng chī shuǐ guǒ",
      "english": "You’ve already dragged out this homework that can be finished in 30 minutes for 3 hours, and it’s still not finished!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Hurry up and do your homework! You can’t have any fruit until you’re finished!"
    }
  ],
